  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Customer/Client)\n\n### Capium 365: Setting up bank feed\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 28 Jul, 2025 at  2:29 PM\n\n### Connecting your bank account to Capium 365 allows for seamless transaction imports and makes reconciliation quick and accurate. Follow the steps below to set up your bank feed from your client login\n\n### Log in to Capium 365\n\nVisit: https://365client.capium.com\n\nEnter your email and password, then click Log in\n\nAfter successful login, you will be redirected to the dashboard:https://365client.capium.com/dashboard\n\n### Navigate to the Bank Section\n\nOn the dashboard, go to Navigation > Bank > Add New Account\n\nIf you don’t have a bank account listed yet, add one here before connecting the feed\n\nPlease refer the screenshot below:\n\n### Choose Your Bank\n\nYou’ll be redirected to a secure page listing various UK banks\n\nSearch and select your bank from the list\n\n### Authorise the Connection\n\nYou’ll now be redirected to your bank’s secure login portal\n\nLog in using your online banking credentials\n\nSelect the account(s) you wish to connect\n\nGive consent to share the data with Capium (this is a standard Open Banking authorisation)\n\nClick Confirm/Allow to finish\n\nPlease refer the screenshot below:\n\nNote: Sync Your Transactions: Once authorised, Capium will begin importing transactions Automaticlly. \n\nYou can go to Bank > Transactions to view and reconcile\n\nIf you're stuck or have issues connecting your bank, feel free to: \n\nUse the support option within Capium 365 to raise a ticket\n\n### \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000201790\">Capium 365 (Customer/Client)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capium 365: Setting up bank feed\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 28 Jul, 2025 at  2:29 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h3 data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"831\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Connecting your bank account to Capium 365 allows for seamless transaction imports and makes reconciliation quick and accurate. Follow the steps below to set up your bank feed from your client login</h3><p data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"651\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h4 data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"427\"><strong data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"432\">Log in to Capium 365</strong></h4><ul data-end=\"749\" data-start=\"465\"><li data-end=\"534\" data-start=\"465\"><p data-end=\"534\" data-start=\"467\">Visit: <a data-end=\"534\" data-start=\"474\" href=\"https://365client.capium.com\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\">https://365client.capium.com</a></p></li><li data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"535\"><p data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"537\">Enter your <strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"548\">email</strong> and <strong data-end=\"574\" data-start=\"562\">password</strong>, then click <strong data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"587\">Log in</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"749\" data-start=\"598\"><p data-end=\"749\" data-start=\"600\">After successful login, you will be redirected to the dashboard:<br data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"667\"><a data-end=\"749\" data-start=\"669\" href=\"https://365client.capium.com/dashboard\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\">https://365client.capium.com/dashboard</a></p></li></ul><p><br></p><h4 data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"751\"><strong data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"756\">Navigate to the Bank Section</strong></h4><ul data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"797\"><li data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"797\"><p data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"799\">On the dashboard, go to <strong data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"823\">Navigation &gt; Bank &gt; Add New Account</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"863\"><p data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"865\" dir=\"ltr\">If you don’t have a bank account listed yet, add one here before connecting the feed</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"865\" dir=\"ltr\">Please refer the screenshot below:</p><p data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"651\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"651\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234774062/original/dAFrwNc3F4a2A6qsDDvQQ4Jfp_ogk4i6Pw.png?1753699838\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234774062\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h4 data-end=\"1081\" data-start=\"1048\"><strong data-end=\"1081\" data-start=\"1053\">Choose Your Bank</strong></h4><ul data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1082\"><li data-end=\"1148\" data-start=\"1082\"><p data-end=\"1148\" data-start=\"1084\">You’ll be redirected to a secure page listing various UK banks</p></li><li data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1149\"><p data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1151\" dir=\"ltr\">Search and select your bank from the list</p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234773931/original/GmBXUgUG5rQvFM36CnRxJHBO33K_JQg2UQ.png?1753699629\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234773931\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"1194\"><strong data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"1199\">Authorise the Connection</strong></h4><ul data-end=\"1527\" data-start=\"1236\"><li data-end=\"1299\" data-start=\"1236\"><p data-end=\"1299\" data-start=\"1238\">You’ll now be redirected to your bank’s secure login portal</p></li><li data-end=\"1350\" data-start=\"1300\"><p data-end=\"1350\" data-start=\"1302\">Log in using your <strong data-end=\"1350\" data-start=\"1320\">online banking credentials</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"1394\" data-start=\"1351\"><p data-end=\"1394\" data-start=\"1353\">Select the account(s) you wish to connect</p></li><li data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1395\"><p data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1397\"><strong data-end=\"1413\" data-start=\"1397\">Give consent</strong> to share the data with Capium (this is a standard Open Banking authorisation)</p></li><li data-end=\"1527\" data-start=\"1492\"><p data-end=\"1527\" data-start=\"1494\" dir=\"ltr\">Click <strong data-end=\"1517\" data-start=\"1500\">Confirm/Allow</strong> to finish</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-end=\"1527\" data-start=\"1494\" dir=\"ltr\">Please refer the screenshot below:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234774254/original/DlwvqMTW_QiU_TUQvv43s1dD2S5FmOxbEQ.png?1753700076\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234774254\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234774318/original/U5jPIm4zdVwmgfPUkXVMnMi8N-jB7GRf8g.png?1753700131\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234774318\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Note</strong>: <strong data-end=\"1550\" data-start=\"1516\" dir=\"ltr\">Sync Your Transactions: Once authorised, Capium will begin importing transactions Automaticlly.&nbsp;</strong></p><p data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1627\" dir=\"ltr\">You can go to <strong data-end=\"1664\" data-start=\"1641\">Bank &gt; Transactions</strong> to view and reconcile</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If you're stuck or have issues connecting your bank, feel free to: </p><p dir=\"ltr\">Use the support option within Capium 365 to raise a ticket<br><br></p><p data-end=\"1624\" data-start=\"1553\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1627\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 data-end=\"1550\" data-start=\"1511\"><br></h4><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000270080\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000270080/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-